node_modules
.env
.env.local
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
bun.lock
storage/framework/sessions/*.json
storage/logs/*.log
storage/framework/cache/
public/storage
storage/app/private/
storage/app/public/

# The database is built, not committed: it is migrations plus seeders, and a
# binary that changes on every run put itself into 76 commits before anybody
# looked. `bun run playground migrate --force && bun run playground db:seed`
# rebuilds it.
database/*.sqlite
# WAL leaves two sidecars beside the database.
database/*.sqlite-shm
database/*.sqlite-wal

# …except this one. The playground is a fixture in this repository, not
# somebody's application: its APP_KEY and AUTH_SECRET are placeholders, and
# `bun test` cannot pass without it — a fresh clone runs against an empty
# database and fails eight tests with no hint as to why. A scaffolded app keeps
# ignoring its own `.env`, which is why the template still does.
!.env
